{
  "title": "Amazing Oven-Roasted Potatoes",
  "description": "Oven-roasted potatoes are a super easy side dish that go well with any meal. This simple recipe uses just a few basic seasonings for fantastic flavor.",
  "servings": "6",
  "instructions": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Line a baking sheet with aluminum foil.\n\nRinse potatoes and dry with a paper towel.\n\nPlace potatoes into a large bowl with oil, seasoned salt, salt, and pepper; mix until well coated.\n\nPour onto the prepared baking sheet and spread into an even layer.\n\nBake in the preheated oven, turning occasionally, until potatoes are tender and golden brown, about 1 hour.",
